          <h3>RTalk - Smalltalk 'Live' Environment on the JVM</h3>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <p>RI Smalltalk developers are developing apps that can run within the Java virtual machine. "RTalk"
              provides a Smalltalk compatible emulation layer that implements a dynamic language on the JVM.</p>
